Subject: [PATCH] arch/arm64: defconfig: Compile Renesas Sound related drivers as Module
To: Simon <horms@verge.net.au>
CC: Magnus <magnus.damm@gmail.com>, <linux-renesas-soc@vger.kernel.org>
